i": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X4FTdF5-QdcQ7kNvwERPTM-&_nc_oc=AdrkOUt9uMoSKd8XDG6ZCm7sv-tkh7kGutks6rH7xt-5pTGo4G3HQ5ZZr8yvXlhwdfE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGLj9oqAYwFT1xRj9LNws6bM5mdDTdeMcwXi_B9zHM8eg&oe=6A7DA5A6"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X-eaHAvEGSAQ7kNvwF9QrfG&_nc_oc=AdrAog46qirgkX8on5WlfTaM17ovmGFZwYO3AohhByCmeYbJy3vNhFCmUXPLdXq2ysI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFPcU1IP1o4JraIPcUxO6zfdRIfg9HcZIRYfgvu_rleYw&oe=6A7D9AF2"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bqOPdOXhQWYQ7kNvwHnhdlb&_nc_oc=AdplCQm_2GxXgDcLL7k30pKSm3wAVhVfgIBQxIMTlKV01JBuy-ApsxOVy5KEUukqvlg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG3VbeedQ6oJ9zheunJScFII_8Y1YawwEonC0R16xtJEQ&oe=6A7DCCFB"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wcjPA6W_6vsQ7kNvwHvXUuL&_nc_oc=AdpU9rRCO3HKz_cXSK0iYsG9hNmnwTUPloNf8I2Xlkp4OsGHBdORpLv46URXLbHTVos&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFEc3wrBQv9clEYDX4iKLDKk9UeTnXxFUNraIM3DdUe0Q&oe=6A7DAA33"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5l2swxevyiYQ7kNvwEXPClH&_nc_oc=Adp4srF988jt3j_OTyEhnWuffXb17c7i1M1UPS8gYFxvpoIugUPZK-Pdxovk6MWJdIQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGr5BCKdRI9n22yOyi4uvykFcdLhAEQDLsL_x6drslofA&oe=6A7DA832"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DNKNH4Da8aAQ7kNvwFb1i9s&_nc_oc=AdpQ9mGF6_jHBUU1bsOaK3witeAuX3IZ2LhJ4Z6usN6ewFTDZD4cu-usMB1NpPmePZg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHD-ze2OSFP-DZvK3d3TBowIR8Z1Znp2ImZm9PljH2BDA&oe=6A7D9F93"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-tgXMLcwdkAQ7kNvwE5xPgR&_nc_oc=AdoHpeAdI1xZLH3M9JJR8KswoAZhqE-2MUpLvouLlVVLEV_kIGmVPhCVdqiJQd7TqPY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGZdlWpyKirMWL8mYNyWWQIY4Qc3-YRKkpcxXfcFdcIGw&oe=6A7D9BAF"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PgYSrfLGWrYQ7kNvwEDb0Gd&_nc_oc=AdrouoVQ2CZUX5aK2iFqH57KP9PyFENqReaFc5yIVituUHaMCvRoxu_w8ACRUeMbEWo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGZgmaZH2MlaZuL6wTVGqrOlhTpzthEhfteDfpxA403aA&oe=6A7DA762"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_973425627254762_